WEBVTT

00:00:00.725 --> 00:00:01.360
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.339 --> 00:00:03.426
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I want to go with you.

00:00:05.419 --> 00:00:06.093
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.580
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> They won’t come tonight.

00:00:10.588 --> 00:00:11.307
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:12.303 --> 00:00:13.627
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> You won’t find a job.

00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:16.381
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:17.306 --> 00:00:18.836
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> We want to learn Russian.

00:00:20.822 --> 00:00:21.638
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.243
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> They want to sell their house.

00:00:26.266 --> 00:00:27.056
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:28.029 --> 00:00:29.579
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I’m sure she won’t win.